<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">A NEW ROUND</view><view class="title">准备好，出发。</view><view class="card space"><view class="section">{{course.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{course.city}} · {{course.holes}} 洞 · 公开记分卡待确认</view></view><view class="section">本轮洞段（按实际顺序）</view><picker range="{{segments}}" range-key="name" value="{{first}}" data-which="first" bindchange="segment"><view class="card">第一段：{{segments[first].name}} ▾</view></picker><picker range="{{second}}" value="{{secondIndex}}" data-which="second" bindchange="segment"><view class="card">第二段：{{second[secondIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><picker wx:if="{{draft.segmentIds.length===2}}" range="{{['第1洞出发','第10洞出发']}}" bindchange="startHole"><view class="card">从第 {{draft.start}} 洞出发 ▾</view></picker><view class="section">同组球友 {{draft.players.length}} / 4</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{draft.players}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><text class="grow">{{item.name}}</text><picker range="{{course.tees}}" data-pid="{{item.id}}" bindchange="tee"><text class="pill">{{item.tee}} ▾</text></picker><text wx:if="{{item.id!=='me'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove"> 移除</text></view></view><view class="choices"><text class="choice" wx:for="{{friends}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="add">＋ {{item.name}}</text><text class="choice" bindtap="temp">＋ 临时球友</text></view><view class="section">快捷玩法</view><view class="choices"><text wx:for="{{templates}}" wx:key="id" class="choice" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="template">{{item.name}}</text></view><view class="card" bindtap="rules"><view class="row"><text>五项规则设置</text><text class="link">{{rulesName}} →</text></view><view class="muted">组队、手动让杆、判罚约定、附加玩法、让杆预览</view></view><button class="primary space" bindtap="start">确认规则，开始记分</button></view>
